== Banking System ==
{{Main|Bank}}
Right-clicking the [[Banker]] will open the {{zone|Bank}} interface. The player will be presented with several options, consisting of the ability to deposit and withdraw {{c}} from either a personal account or an account shared with the player's co-op, viewing previous [[Bank|Banking]] activity, and upgrading the co-op [[Bank]] account.

{{C|alt=Coins}} stored in the Bank are not lost when the player [[Death|dies]].

=== Bank Upgrades ===
Players are able to upgrade their co-op bank account with {{C}} and {{Item|Enchanted Gold Block}}s after meeting the respective [[Gold]] Collection and Museum Milestone requirement, which is viewable in the upgrade screen. Upgrading the [[Bank]] account increases the maximum amount of {{C}} able to be stored in the bank, and increases the maximum interest able to be gained. Upgrading Bank accounts also rewards {{SkyBlock Experience}}.

At least {{C|10m}} must be stored in the co-op bank and the purse combined before the upgrade screen is unlocked.

Upgrading your co-op account will also upgrade your personal account. Your personal account's max amount will always be 20% of your co-op account's max.
== Trivia ==
*Unlike most other NPCs, '''Banker''' stands on the verge of 2 blocks, rather than in the middle of one.
*Other islands feature other Banker NPCs, serving the same purpose, namely {{NPCSprite|Banker Barry}} or {{NPCSprite|Banker Broadjaw}}, {{NPCSprite|Belanor}} or {{NPCSprite|Bruto}}.

